<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3-yr state bond yield drops to 22.99 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3-yr state bond yield drops to 22.99 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's 1999/C government bond was set by auction at 22.99 percent, down from 24.44 percent set at an auction on August 15, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     7,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     25,359.40 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    8,750 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 9,187.50 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  22.99 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		  102.19 pct</p>
</text>
